; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 805, August 1（1 year and 4 months after the Motoki Station mass-frenzy killings）<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\施設.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The verdict was handed down a short while ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The sentence, as the prosecution demanded: death. Death.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the defendant, has been sentenced to death.</STYLE><PG>
I'd always pictured death-sentence news being reported with a lot more commotion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Reporters from the gallery rushing out in front of the courthouse and making a fuss, that kind of picture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this verdict wasn't like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a verdict delivered as if it were only natural.<PG>
It's not someone else's business, but it's nothing much to be surprised about either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> did things that deserved it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, even though we're relatives, I don't seem to have enough compassion to defend <STYLE ID="3">her</STYLE>.<BR>
If anything, it's because of <STYLE ID="3">this person</STYLE> that <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE> were arrested.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She should get a fitting punishment.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE>, your ride is here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ah, yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that voice, I grab my bag right away and head for the exit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\cicadas.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\施設外.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Director, thank you for everything this past year!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bow deeply to the director.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It'll be hard in all sorts of ways, but hang in there! Come visit us again!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes!"</STYLE><PG>
The only one seeing me off is the director.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I asked for it to be kept a secret from the other kids.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not very good with goodbyes like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I go out the front door and head for the gate.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey. It's been a week."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Aha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurry over to <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> and grab his arm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today I leave this children's home in Motoki-cho and go back to the Arata settlement.<PG>
For more than 1 year now, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> has come to see me every so often.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> never gave the instruction to stop looking after me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking advantage of that, I forced my way into staying on in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, I went to see both <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE> now and then.<PG>
And today, since my state of mind has gotten better, and to coincide with this August 1, I'm going to stand on my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Standing on my own just means going back to the Arata settlement, but even so, the way I live should change a lot from before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, I don't want to leave Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because my place to belong is here...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"We're meeting at Zahha today. No objections, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah! Hey, hey, you're off duty today, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, yeah. So today my days as </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> stand-in parent end, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm, stand-in parent, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stare at <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san's</STYLE> profile with a sidelong, smoldering look.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't...! How long do you plan to keep up that seduction act!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh! So you DID find me alluring!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">"Just shut up, shut up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ahahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're really a lolicon forever and ever!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Honestly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="6">you've</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> gotten... how do I put it... brighter."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\優しい言葉で低い.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"That's because time has passed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, that's not it. You're brighter than when we first met."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Before we get to Zahha, I'll tell you about the incident on April 8 last year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I still hadn't told you all of it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\伊勢運転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The mass-frenzy killings at Motoki Station that occurred on Shiyo 804, April 8.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
3 people died in that incident, and 7 were seriously injured.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In 6 of the 7 survivors, the frenzy didn't subside even after the incident, and they kept thrashing about, trying to kill one another.<PG>
But a certain drug had a dramatic effect on those symptoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A drug called falsificaso.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This drug is something <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> made.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When it was administered to the surviving victims, everyone's symptoms subsided.<PG>
Based on all this, the police announced it was a terrorist attack using some drug or nerve gas.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even those who became perpetrators were all counted as victims, and I was treated entirely as a victim too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I was never arrested, and until my mind and body showed improvement, I was in the care of the children's home in Motoki-cho.<PG>
But the police didn't try to look into it any further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though they knew the cause, the police avoided looking into it further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE>, too, was frustrated about that part, but if there were orders from the National Police Agency, there was nothing to be done.<PG>
Even so, maybe the saving grace is that <STYLE ID="8">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE>, who'd been missing, were found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> accepted that the old case had been solved too, and he settled down.<PG>
But I no longer hid anything from <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> had told me―
{PAUSE ""}
the green eyes―
{PAUSE ""}
and the irresistible desire to kill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I told <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> everything I knew.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"So, anyway, the victims from back then are all back in society. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">They'll probably still need psychological follow-up from here on, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Won't I get a criminal record?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Of course you won't. It was 'terrorism,' after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... I knew all of it, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"All you did was know, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... but still..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Do you feel responsible?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Of course I do!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You've already taken responsibility. You revealed the truth about </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, got the specific remedy ready, and we were able to arrest </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Isn't that enough?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Are you still thinking about it? About </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's why we're going to Zahha today, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Look, we're almost there."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\cicadas.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before getting out of the car, I take one big, deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even so, the situation doesn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To accept that unchanging situation, to turn my heart even a little in a better direction, I take a deep breath.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"You okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Is this really... okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"She's the one who brought it up. It's fine."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"My hand... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">hold it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a moment, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> squeezes my right hand tight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't worry, I'm with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah... thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"All right."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Hearing my answer, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> quickly lets go of my hand and gets out of the car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing the driver's door open, I make up my mind too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
Riding that momentum, I get out of the car too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-saaan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, over here, over here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At a table in the back, <STYLE ID="10">Goto-san</STYLE> is waving at us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"You okay? Can you do this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah, I'm fine now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even as I say I'm fine, I keep hold of <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san's</STYLE> arm as I head over to <STYLE ID="10">Goto-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Man, it's hot. That's August for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"No, no―it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">HOT</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> in here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"What is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> are!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">"D-don't be stupid! It's not that kind of relationship!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> comes out with that, so I kick him in the Achilles <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="けん">tendon</STYLE> with the tip of my foot.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ow! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what are you doing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I don't care!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">"Honestly, what's that about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh my, oh myyy! Now, now, you two, sit down, sit down!"</STYLE>
