Urged on by <STYLE ID="10">Goto-san</STYLE>, we take our seats too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sitting at this table are me, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="10">Goto-san</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
and.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uh, nice to meet you! My name's Kana Niimura..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Nice to meet you. I'm Natsumi Kogori."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san's</STYLE> neck, a faint scar remains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Needless to say, I'm the one who gave it to her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Despite the size of the wound and the bleeding, <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE> escaped with her life.<PG>
From what I've heard, right before I attacked, <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE> sensed the danger too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thanks to that, she just barely avoided bleeding to death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, the bleeding was severe, and it took her several months to be discharged.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm truly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pressed my head to the table and offered <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE> my <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="わ">apology</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights, I should have gone to apologize much sooner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> told me it was better to wait until I'd calmed down, so I put it off until this very day.<PG>
But the longer I put it off, the scarier it got to meet her like this and apologize.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE> was nearly killed by me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way she'd be glad to meet someone like me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―is that okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a voice gentler than I'd imagined, <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE> checks my name and what to call me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"I was searching for </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> for so, so long. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">―thanks to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> came back. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">So I'm really grateful to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Today's the day of the verdict, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> couldn't come, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"And I've heard properly why you attacked me, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, I'm not going to blame you, and more than anything, the one who suffered most was you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, wasn't it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... it doesn't change the fact that I did it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what did you come here for today?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　To blame yourself?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Or to meet me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, if you came to blame yourself, I'm going home right now, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I don't want to hear that, and just hearing it hurts."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Which do you mean by that 'I'm sorry' just now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　That you attacked me? That you're blaming yourself right now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That I'm blaming myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="9">"Okay! Then that's the end of this talk!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　I came here today to thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">."</STYLE><PG>
With that, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> pats me on the back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
