{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san's</STYLE> hand is saying 'good for you.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Head still bowed, I nod silently, to no one in particular.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
