<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't―! I told you, me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> are...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, when are you going to call me by my name?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I've been waiting for more than 1 year now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ride the flow too, and seize the moment to throw what I've wanted to say at <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Ahh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, that's pretty hurtful. Right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"That's right! What are you getting all shy about?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"D-d-d-d-don't be stupid!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　To begin with, going out with a </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="・・">15</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">-year-old girl is...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
