<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="9">"Sorry, maybe we teased him a bit too much..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
