{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"No, um... I didn't know what kind of thing would be good... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I went back and forth a lot, but I thought that might be good... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
