{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, 3 days ago, July 29, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> birthday, you know?</STYLE>
