<STYLE ID="9">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, let it go. It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> birthday today..."</STYLE>
